 "tip": {
  "id": "springbok",
  "title": "Thin the springbok",
  "text": "Springbok are the commonest antelope and the main prey of Etosha hyenas. Lower their numbers and watch hyenas, cheetahs, jackals and lions shift to other prey."
 },
